        </Ctlg>
      </BoQInfo>
      <BoQBody>
        <BoQCtgy ID="C0" RNoPart="1">
          <LblTx><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-family:Arial; font-size:10pt">Site setup civil works + [PERSON_127] general</span><br/></LblTx>
          <BoQBody>
            <BoQCtgy ID="C1" RNoPart="1">
              <LblTx><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-family:Arial; font-size:10pt">Site setup</span><br/></LblTx>
              <BoQBody>
                <Itemlist>
                  <Remark ID="R0">
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">The contractor has to set up his site setup on the plot made available by the AG or apartial area, maintain it and clear it again after completion of the construction measure.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Material, workshop and/or crew containers according to the bidder's requirement incl. provision of crane, provision of electrical cables for connecting the BE to the construction power distribution.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">The site is to be set up in such a way that structures can be properly erected or altered and that no dangers, avoidable disadvantages or avoidable nuisances arise.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">For the supply and disposal of the site a sanitary container is to be supplied, set up, kept available on site and cleared by the AN; billing in separate items.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">The sanitary container is also shared by a third-party company working on the construction plot.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Site setup civil works and [PERSON_127]</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Remark>
                  <Remark ID="R1">
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Construction water can be taken from the a hydrant east of Immerwahrstraße next to the footpath in the immediate vicinity of the  at the site: 2 fixed coupling B DIN 14318.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">After the withdrawal the connection is to be properly shut off again. A suitable hose is to be brought along by the contractor. </span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">The contractor has to apply for the withdrawal at the technical department of the FAU. Meter, or as far as required standpipe, are to be provided by the contractor.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">The construction power supply is provided by others on site from building 114 (Materials Science building) east of Immerwahrstraße, in the immediate vicinity of the site, distance approx. 100 m.Connected load 400 V, fuse protection max. 63 Amp.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Work for crossing Immerwahrstraße see "Site setup civil works + [PERSON_127]"</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Connection possibilities for construction water and construction power</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Remark>
                  <Item ID="I0" RNoPart="1">
                    <UPBkdn>No</UPBkdn>
                    <Qty>1</Qty>
                    <QU>St</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Sanitary container, set up and clear, heatable, electric, energy costs heating are borne by the AG, double-walled, insulated, single container length 5 m, single container width up to 2,1 m, prepare and clear standing area,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Sanitary container for shared use by third-party company on the site.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Producing and clearing the supply and disposal connections of the container within the site setup are paid separately, maintaining and operating are paid separately, for washroom and toilet room, 2 toilets with hand basin, separate for ladies and gentlemen, water supply with cold and hot water, two urinals, for one tapping point inside, room furnished, incl. lighting.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Sanitary container set up clear double-walled, insulated L 5m </span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">B 2,1m prepare clear standing area, use with third-party company</span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
                  <Item ID="I1" RNoPart="2">
                    <UPBkdn>No</UPBkdn>
                    <Qty>28</Qty>
                    <QU>Wo</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">STLB-Bau 04/2020 000</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Sanitary container maintain and operate supply and disposal facilities incl. cleaning, 2 x weekly and heating, energy costs heating are borne by the AG.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Billing by weeks of construction period</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
