                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Weather protection tent, for civil works, inside temperature to be maintained min. 10 degrees C, at an outside temperature below 10 degrees C to 0 degrees C, </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">for clear trench width up to 3m</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">length up to 8m, height 2,3 m</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">set up and clear, brace and anchor to the devices existing on the structure, clad with transparent building materials building material class DIN 4102-1 B2 (normally flammable), incl. substructure, bracing and fixing, join the joints rainproof and windproof, avoid inflation by wind, edge connections rainproof and windproof on all sides, standing surface level, directly loadable, substrate soil.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
