                        </STLBBauID>
                      </STLBBau>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Soil for [PERSON_121] from ground surface for exposing cables and lines, loosen true to profile, store at the side, backfill, compact, shoring is paid separately, base width over 1 to 1,5 m, excavation depth up to 3 m,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">homogeneous zone 2, with one soil group, soil group 1 SU DIN 18196 (sand-[PERSON_033]-mixture), depth of upper horizon of the homogeneous zone from 0 m, depth of lower horizon of the homogeneous zone up to 3 m,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">construction measure of geotechnical category 1 DIN 4020,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">- consistency DIN EN ISO 14688-1 stiff,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">execution according to individual description,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">[PERSON_141]</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"> carry out with equipment and predominantly by hand. </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Installation: </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Deformation modulus min. EV2 45 MPa</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Degree of compaction min. DPr 0,97</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Layer thickness in each case in layers over 15-20 cm</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Quantity determination by measurement at the place of extraction.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">[PERSON_121] loosen store backfill compact base B 1-1,5m T up to 3m SU</span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
                  <Item ID="I52" RNoPart="2">
                    <UPBkdn>No</UPBkdn>
                    <Qty>10</Qty>
                    <QU>St</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Producing an electronic photo documentation of the trial pit and of the lines found in each case, stating line diameter, type of line and medium. The AG receives the documentation in 2 copies as a printout in [PERSON_097] as well as in electronic form in PDF format incl. all photos in JPG format.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Including tables of contents with the details  (structure, date, location details) of the pictures shown.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">The surveyor of the AG is to be notified to measure the lines found; only after the measurement by the surveyor may the trial pit be backfilled.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Billing per trial pit</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Digital documents in PDF format,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">photos in JPG format (image size min. 900x600 pixels)</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Produce photo documentation trial pit</span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
                  <Item ID="I53" RNoPart="3">
                    <UPBkdn>No</UPBkdn>
                    <Qty>1140</Qty>
                    <QU>m3</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Soil of the trenches for supply lines, </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">in trench with trench shoring unit</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">, loosen true to profile, load, convey, store, conveying distance up to 2 km, transport via public roads, work with equipment, shoring is paid separately, with obstruction by supply lines, disposal lines and cables, securing is paid separately, width of the base over 2,5 to 3 m, excavation depth up to 3 m,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">homogeneous zone 2, with one soil group, soil group 1 SU DIN 18196 (sand-[PERSON_033]-mixture), depth of upper horizon of the homogeneous zone from 0 m, depth of lower horizon of the homogeneous zone up to 3 m,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">construction measure of geotechnical category 1 DIN 4020,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">- consistency DIN EN ISO 14688-1 stiff, execution according to individual description:</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Owing to the numerous utilities present in the existing ground and the confined construction field, more difficult machine excavation is as a matter of principle to be included in the price</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Soil trench supply line with equipment loosen load convey store 3km with equipment base B 2,5-3m T up to 3m SU</span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
