                      <CompleteText>
                        <ComplTSA>Yes</ComplTSA>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Soil of the trenches for supply lines, loosen true to profile, load, convey, store, conveying distance up to 2 km, transport via public roads, work by hand, shoring is paid separately, with obstruction by supply lines, disposal lines and cables, securing is paid separately, width of the base over 2,5 to 3 m, excavation depth up to 3 m, </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">homogeneous zone 2, with one soil group, soil group 1 SU DIN 18196 (sand-[PERSON_033]-mixture), depth of upper horizon of the homogeneous zone from 0 m, depth of lower horizon of the homogeneous zone up to 3 m, </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">construction measure of geotechnical category 1 DIN 4020, </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">- consistency DIN EN ISO 14688-1 stiff, execution according to individual description, </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                          <TextComplement Kind="Owner" MarkLbl="11" ArtChrIdent="-484">
                            <ComplCaption><span>Individual description no. </span></ComplCaption>
                            <ComplBody><span> </span><br/><span>Manual work when exposing within a radius of 0,5m around the obstacle. </span></ComplBody>
                            <ComplTail><span/></ComplTail>
                          </TextComplement>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">.</span></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Soil trench supply line loosen load convey store 2km by hand base B 2,5-3m T up to 3m SU</span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
                  <Item ID="I57" RNoPart="7">
                    <UPBkdn>No</UPBkdn>
                    <RefDescr>Ref</RefDescr>
                    <Qty>120</Qty>
                    <QU>m3</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Soil of the trenches for supply lines, loosen true to profile, with excavation control by a qualified person of the AG acc. to §20 SprengG, load, convey, store, conveying distance up to 3 km, transport via public roads, work with equipment, shoring is paid separately, with obstruction by supply lines, disposal lines and cables, securing is paid separately, width of the base over 2,5 to 3 m, excavation depth up to 3 m,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">homogeneous zone 2, with one soil group, soil group 1 SU DIN 18196 (sand-[PERSON_033]-mixture), depth of upper horizon of the homogeneous zone from 0 m, depth of lower horizon of the homogeneous zone up to 3 m,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">construction measure of geotechnical category 1 DIN 4020,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">- consistency DIN EN ISO 14688-1 stiff. </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Owing to the numerous utilities present in the existing ground and the confined construction field, more difficult machine excavation is as a matter of principle to be included in the price.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Remove soil with equipment in thin layers as specified by the qualified person. </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Results are documented by the qualified person of the AG acc. to separate contract.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Soil trench supply line with equipment, incl. excavation control qualified person AG, T up to 3m loosen load convey store 3km base B 2,5-3m SU</span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
                  <Item ID="I58" RNoPart="8">
                    <UPBkdn>No</UPBkdn>
                    <RefDescr>Rep</RefDescr>
                    <RefRNo IDRef="I57"/>
                    <Qty>5</Qty>
                    <QU>m3</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Work by hand</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Manual work when exposing within a radius of 0,5m around the obstacle.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Remove soil by hand in thin layers as specified by the qualified person. </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Soil trench supply line by hand incl. excavation control qualified person AG, T up to 3m loosen load convey store 3km base B 2,5-3m SU</span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
                  <Item ID="I59" RNoPart="9">
                    <UPBkdn>No</UPBkdn>
                    <Qty>60</Qty>
                    <QU>m3</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Rock from ground surface,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">loosen true to profile, load, convey, store, conveying distance up to 3 km, transport via public roads, shoring is paid separately, with obstruction by shoring, supply and disposal lines,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">total width over 2 to 3 m,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">total length over 15 to 20 m,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">excavation depth up to 3 m,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">homogeneous zone 3, depth of upper horizon of the homogeneous zone from 3 m, depth of lower horizon of the homogeneous zone up to 5 m,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">estimated share of the homogeneous zone in the total excavation quantity 5 %,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">construction measure of geotechnical category 1 DIN 4020,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">- one rock type: sandstone,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">- weathering and alterations DIN EN ISO 14689 moderately weathered,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">- variable DIN EN ISO 14689,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">- discontinuity spacing DIN EN ISO 14689 thick,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">- [PERSON_030] (azimuth) </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"> 135 </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"> degrees,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">- discontinuity direction dip angle 45 degrees,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">- prismatic rock block DIN EN ISO 14689, quantity determination by measurement at the place of extraction.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Rock homogeneous zone X1 loosen load convey store 3km T up to 3m 1 rock type sandstone</span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
                  <Item ID="I60" RNoPart="10">
                    <UPBkdn>No</UPBkdn>
                    <Qty>530</Qty>
                    <QU>m2</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Shoring with trench shoring unit DIN 4124, height of shoring over 3 to 3,5 m, width of the base between the sheeting over 2,5 to 3 m, one soil group, soil group 1 SU DIN 18196 (sand-[PERSON_033]-mixture), construct and remove again, end shoring is paid separately, execution according to individual description:  </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Billing by length of the axis of the shoring horizontally and the height from the excavation pit base, in the case of partial trench shoring from its bottom edge, up to 10 cm above top edge of ground. </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">To be constructed contiuously with the soil excavation and with low vibration.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Trench shoring unit H 3-3,5m base B 2,5-3m SU construct remove</span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
