                  <Item ID="I106" RNoPart="2">
                    <UPBkdn>No</UPBkdn>
                    <Qty>5</Qty>
                    <QU>m</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Removal of the kerb of concrete for later reuse, as part of a partial demolition measure, shape TB 10/25, clean removed kerb and store at the side on pallets for later reinstallation.  Demolish foundation of concrete and one-sided backing support, bedding thickness 20 cm, thickness of the backing support 10 cm, unit weight of the demolition material DIN EN 1991-1-1 24 kN/m3, use of equipment is possible, max. total weight up to 20 t, execution low-vibration DIN 4150, low-noise, noise level max. 80 dB(A), sort materials taken up for disposal, collect, </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">load onto truck of the AN, </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">collect materials taken up, load onto truck of the AN, transport, dispose of, to the storage/to the facility according to [PERSON_125] of the AN, </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                          <TextComplement Kind="Bidder" MarkLbl="11" ArtChrIdent="-1">
                            <ComplCaption><span>Facility (designation/location) </span></ComplCaption>
                            <ComplBody><span/><br/><span/><br/><span>  .......................... </span></ComplBody>
                            <ComplTail><span/></ComplTail>
                          </TextComplement>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">to be entered by the bidder,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">waste is not hazardous, not contaminated, classification Z 0 (unrestricted installation), waste code acc. to AVV (Waste Catalogue Ordinance) 170101 concrete, quantity determination by measurement, </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Payment for the disposal is borne by AN.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Removal kerb concrete for reuse TB10/25 24kN/m3 equipment use poss. TB10/25 24kN/m3, load transp. truck AN dispose of not contaminated AVV170101 paym.disposal </span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
                  <Item ID="I107" RNoPart="3">
                    <UPBkdn>No</UPBkdn>
                    <Qty>4</Qty>
                    <QU>m</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Cut through existing asphalt pavement completely and with clean edges using a cutting machine.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Quantity determination by measurement.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Thickness of the pavement:</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">up to 15 cm</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Cut asphalt pavement up to 15 cm</span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
                  <Item ID="I108" RNoPart="4">
                    <UPBkdn>No</UPBkdn>
                    <Qty>4</Qty>
                    <QU>m3</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Demolition of the asphalt base course and surface course in carriageways, as part of a partial demolition measure, thickness over 10 to 20 cm, in a strip along kerb Cauerstraße, width approx. 50 to 80 cm, use of equipment is possible, max. total weight up to 20 t, </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">collect the removed materials, load onto the AN's lorry, transport, dispose of, to the storage site/to the facility as per [PERSON_125] of the AN, </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                          <TextComplement Kind="Bidder" MarkLbl="11" ArtChrIdent="-1">
                            <ComplCaption><span>Facility (designation/location) </span></ComplCaption>
                            <ComplBody><span/><br/><span/><br/><span>  .......................... </span></ComplBody>
                            <ComplTail><span/></ComplTail>
                          </TextComplement>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">to be entered by the bidder,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">waste is not hazardous, not contaminated with pollutants, RuVA-StB recycling class A, waste code acc. to AVV (Waste Catalogue Ordinance) 170302 bituminous mixtures,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">the disposal fees are borne by the AG.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Demolish asphalt layer carriageway D 10-20cm use of equipment poss. load transp. lorry AN dispose of up to 20km not contaminated with pollutants AVV170302 disposal-[PERSON_062]. AG</span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
                  <Item ID="I109" RNoPart="5">
                    <UPBkdn>No</UPBkdn>
                    <Qty>2</Qty>
                    <QU>m2</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Milling of the bituminous [FIRMA_101], as part of a partial demolition measure, in carriageways, with asphalt surface course of stone mastic asphalt, in strips, width 50 cm, depth over 3 to 3,5 cm, trim edges vertically, clean surfaces, loosen layers that do not adhere firmly, </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">collect the removed materials, load onto the AN's lorry, transport, dispose of, to the storage site/to the facility as per [PERSON_125] of the AN, </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                          <TextComplement Kind="Bidder" MarkLbl="11" ArtChrIdent="-1">
                            <ComplCaption><span>Facility (designation/location) </span></ComplCaption>
                            <ComplBody><span/><br/><span/><br/><span>  .......................... </span></ComplBody>
                            <ComplTail><span/></ComplTail>
                          </TextComplement>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">to be entered by the bidder,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">waste is not hazardous, not contaminated with pollutants, RuVA-StB recycling class A, waste code acc. to AVV (Waste Catalogue Ordinance) 170302 bituminous mixtures,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">the disposal fees are borne by the AG.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Mill [FIRMA_101] carriageway B 50cm T 3-3,5cm load transp. lorry AN dispose of up to 20km not contaminated with pollutants AVV170302 disposal-[PERSON_062]. AG</span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
                  <Item ID="I110" RNoPart="6">
                    <UPBkdn>No</UPBkdn>
                    <Qty>2</Qty>
                    <QU>m3</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">STLB-Bau 04/2020 084</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Demolition of the pavement without [PERSON_147] of crushed stone-chippings-crushed sand mixture, in carriageway areas, as part of a partial demolition measure, unit weight of the demolition material DIN EN 1991-1-1 20 kN/m3, thickness over 20 to 30 cm,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">use of equipment is possible, max. total weight up to 20 t, execution low-vibration DIN 4150, low-noise, noise level max. 80 dB(A),</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">sort the removed materials for reuse, collect, store reusable materials at the side, collect non-reusable materials, and store on the site,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">waste is not hazardous, not contaminated with pollutants, </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">classification Z 0 (unrestricted installation), </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">quantity determination by measurement.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Pavement without [PERSON_147] </span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">crushed stone-chippings-crushed sand mixture carriageway areas </span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">demolish 20kN/m3 D 20-30cm use of equipment poss. </span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">store reusable materials not contaminated with pollutants</span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
                </Itemlist>
              </BoQBody>
            </BoQCtgy>
            <BoQCtgy ID="C17" RNoPart="2">
              <LblTx><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-family:Arial; font-size:10pt">[ORT_030]</span><br/></LblTx>
              <BoQBody>
                <Itemlist>
                  <Remark ID="R25">
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">[ORT_030] sewer trench, pipe trench</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">[ORT_030] sewer trench, pipe trench</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Remark>
                  <Remark ID="R26">
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-weight:bold; font-family:Arial">Ground conditions</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">A soil report is available for the directly neighbouring construction site NTC main building. </span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-weight:bold; font-family:Arial">Information on the homogeneous zones see annex no. 5</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">According to the report, the groundwater level in the area of the NTC construction field lies at depths between 290,00 m above NN to 289,53 m above NN. The surface of the construction site lies at approximately 293,90 m above NN.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">There are sandy cover layers, generally of medium density. </span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">The main pipeline route runs predominantly under the current fire brigade perimeter road, north of the central workshop and the IZNF,with a carriageway structure, paving and base courses in a thickness of approx. 60-70 cm.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Ground conditions, information on the homogeneous zones</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Remark>
                  <Remark ID="R27">
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Preliminary remark billing width trench excavation</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Depending on the type of pipeline or type of cable, the minimum trench width according to DIN 4124 or DIN EN 1610 is billed. Billing vertical.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">In areas with formwork and shoring constructions, 2 x 15cm can additionally be billed on top of the width.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Preliminary remark billing width trench excavation</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Remark>
                  <Remark ID="R28">
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Standard description</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Quantity determination of the soil movements by measurement at the</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">place of installation in installed condition.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Standard description</span><span style="text-align:left; font-style:italic; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Remark>
