gn:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Layer thickness pipe cover: 20 cm</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
