                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Soil, stored outside the site, install true to profile, conveying distance up to 3 km, transport via public roads, with one soil group, soil group 1 SU DIN 18196 (sand-[PERSON_033] mixture), compact, deformation modulus min. EV2 45 MPa, degree of compaction min. DPr 0,95, installation height up to 2,5 m, quantity determination by fill profiles, execution acc. to individual description, </span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
