                      </STLBBau>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Pre-insulated bonded pipeline [PERSON_089]/plastic DIN EN 253 for buried installation, inner pipe of welded steel pipe P235TR1 DIN EN 10217-1, with inspection certificate 3.1 DIN EN 10204, with leak-tightness test DIN EN 489-1, for [PERSON_044], max. operating temperature 130 deg C, max. operating overpressure 2,5 MPa (25 bar), single pipeline, outside diameter inner pipe 273 mm, outside diameter casing 400 mm, fittings and connectors are paid separately, insulation - standard, laying in existing trenches, with shoring and bracing, trench/excavation pit depth over 1,75 to 2,5 m, incl. measuring line for signalling and locating moisture in the insulation, by the transit-time measuring method, with line of copper, 2 x 1,5 mm2, incl. heat-resistant connection of the measuring element, junction box and connecting line as well as measuring line connections.</span></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">[PERSON_089] welded </span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">[PERSON_044] [PERSON_052] AD 273mm AD 400mm T 1,75-2,5m </span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">measuring line</span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
