                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Design, like a perpendicular branch, at the outlet end with factory foamed-in ball valve with reduced bore, incl. shrunk-on end cap, tested acc. to DIN EN 489.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
