                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Connection to pipeline [PERSON_044] [PERSON_089] [PERSON_031] AD </span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">273mm remove cold insulation [PERSON_089] [PERSON_031] DN250</span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
