                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Segment cuts DN250, cut plastic casing pipe to length by machine perpendicular to the pipe axis, cut back and remove casing pipe and insulating foam from the cut point to requird length, clean carrier pipe, cut measuring wires to length, preparation of change of direction at the weld seam deviation up to max. 5 deg, weld preparation on the carrier pipe by bevelling the cut edge by approx. 30 deg, deburr inside of pipe.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Segment ct for changes of direction at which no prefabricated bend can be installed, payment as required instruction project supervision.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Segment cuts DN250, cut plastic casing pipe to length by machine </span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">perpendicular to the pipe axis, casing pipe and </span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">insulating foam</span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
