                    <QU>St</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Shrink socket Da 125 mm, tested acc. to DIN EN 489, for aeration and venting, incl. accessories and connection of the wires of the leak indication, L = 0,7 m, adjustment of length in workshop and assembly planning,</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
