                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Pressure pipe of PE 100 DIN EN 12201-1 and DIN EN 12201-2 without protective jacket, for drinking water, DN/OD 63, SDR 11, on drums, with plain ends, laying DIN EN 805, in existing trench, shored, bedding is paid separately, laying depth over 1,25 to 1,75 m.</span></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
