                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Flange tension-resistant DN50/ PN10/16 ;</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">EU piece, on one side with flange acc. to EN 1092-2, on the other side with push-in socket for the longitudinally force-lockked connection with PE pipes acc. to DIN 8074, PE-X pipes acc. to DIN 16893 and PVC pipes acc. to DIN 8062. Material:Housing: GJS-400, corrosion protection by epoxy resin powder coating inside and outside in accordance with quality assurance RAL-GZ 662 of the quality association HeavyCorrosion Protection - GSK taking into account DIN 3476 (P) and DIN 30677-2</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Clamp: brass</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Including bolts and washers</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
