                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Pressure tapping valve of PE for pipes of PE DIN 8074 and DIN 8075 for tapping of lines for electrofusion welding, with outlet spigot, main pipe DN/OD 160, outlet spigot DN/OD 63, for drinking water, buried, laying depth over 1,25 to 1,75 m.</span></Text>
