                  <Item ID="I195" RNoPart="12">
                    <UPBkdn>No</UPBkdn>
                    <Qty>3</Qty>
                    <QU>St</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Gate valve with PE pipe spigot d63 on both sides with integrated support sleeve of stainless [PERSON_089].</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">[PERSON_017] with flange on both sides acc. to EN 1092-2.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Wedge and [PERSON_155] vulcanised over the full surface. [PERSON_155] connected to the wedge flexibly, vibration-damping and free of play by form fit and elastomer embedding. [PERSON_155] = 1,2 x spindle diameter. Wedge guide of wear-resistant plastic with high sliding property ensures low wear and minimal closing torques.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Spindle with rolled thread and rolled smooth in the area of the O-ring seal. Maintenance-free spindle seal by 5-fold O-ring seal. O-ring carrier connected corrosion-proof by double bayonet to the bonnet coated on all sides.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Test basis: EN 1074-1, EN 1074-2 and EN 12266-1</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Material:</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Housing: GJS-400, corrosion protection by epoxy resin powder coating inside and outside in accordance with quality assurance RAL-GZ 662 of the quality association Heavy Corrosion Protection - GSK taking into account DIN 3476-1 (coating thickness: min. 0,25 mm, freedom from pores at 3 kV, adhesion inside and outside min. 12 N/mm² after hot water storage, proof of suitability for drinking water, external monitoring by neutral test institute)</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Spindle: stainless duplex steel</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Wedge nut: brass</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Wedge: GJS-400, with [PERSON_155] vulcanised with EPDM in accordance with DVGW W 270 and UBA KTW for drinking water</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">PE ends: PE 100, pipe wall thickness acc. to DIN 8074</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Support sleeves: stainless steel</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Medium: well water</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Max. operating pressure: 16 bar</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">PE pipe spigot: d 63 mm, SDR 11</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Gate valve with PE pipe spigot d63 on both sides</span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
                  <Item ID="I196" RNoPart="13">
                    <UPBkdn>No</UPBkdn>
                    <Qty>3</Qty>
                    <QU>St</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Extension spindle telescopic, for the operation of tapping valves in buried pipeline construction, with indicator disc of plastic for half turn, with round-thread bell for pinless fastening of the extension spindle to the round-thread adapter of the shut-off valve, with wing cap under operating square for upper support in the support plate of the surface box, wing cap pressed with sleeve pipe, coupling socket with bore and split pin for the pull-out-proof connection of the extension spindle with the spindle of the shut-off valve, with sleeve pipe of PE-HD.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Material:</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Round-thread bell: GJL-250, corrosion protection by epoxy resin powder coating inside and outside in accordance with quality assurance RAL-GZ 662 of the quality association Heavy Corrosion Protection - GSK taking into account DIN 3476 (P) and DIN 30677-2 (coating thickness: min. 0,25 mm, freedom from pores at 3 kV, adhesion inside and outside min. 12 N/mm² after hot water storage, proof of suitability for drinking water, external monitoring by neutral test institute)</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Key socket and coupling socket: GJS-400, bituminised, galvanised</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Key rod: [PERSON_089] S355J2G3 acc. to DIN EN 10025 - galvanised</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Sleeve pipe: PE-HD</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Extension spindle telescopic, for the operation of </span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">tapping valves in buried pipeline construction, with </span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">indicator disc of</span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
