                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Surface box height-adjustable, consisting of box, adjusting ring and cover with retaining pin,  for installation in bituminous traffic areas, suitable for house connection gate valves, valve saddles and tapping valves, size based on DIN 4057, inclined seat on cover and adjusting ring reduces tendency of the cover to rattle, cover with epoxy resin powder coating to avoid contact corrosion between cover and adjusting ring, with direction arrow on box housing.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Material:</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Box/adjusting ring: GJL-200, bituminised</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Cover: GJS-400, corrosion protection by epoxy resin powder coating</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Retaining pin/washer/split pin: stainless [PERSON_089]</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Surface box height-adjustable, consisting of box, adjusting ring </span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">and cover with retaining pin,  for installation in bituminous</span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
