                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Garden hydrant DN50 telescopic extension spindle 0,94 - 1,60m</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Single hydrant - set for use in the frost-free area below ground, connection: internal thread on both sides, outlet bend 90°, automatic draining of the outlet side on shut-off; flange plate for fastening, valve and connection parts of [PERSON_176], telescopic extension spindle, protective pipe, guide disc, plastic sealing plug with chain, riser key with operating square width across flats 11,5 mm, hydrant box</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Including riser pipe</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Design with telescopic extension spindle 0,94 m - 1,60 m</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Garden hydrant DN50 telescopic extension spindle 0,94 - 1,60m</span><span style="text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
